{
  "sn46.56:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 46.56 ",
  "sn46.56:0.2": "6. Sākacchavagga ",
  "sn46.56:0.3": "Abhayasutta ",
  "sn46.56:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn46.56:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati gijjhakūṭe pabbate. ",
  "sn46.56:1.3": "Atha kho abhayo rājakumāro yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho abhayo rājakumāro bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn46.56:1.4": "“pūraṇo, bhante, kassapo evamāha: ",
  "sn46.56:1.5": "‘natthi hetu, natthi paccayo aññāṇāya adassanāya. ",
  "sn46.56:1.6": "Ahetu, appaccayo aññāṇaṁ adassanaṁ hoti. ",
  "sn46.56:1.7": "Natthi hetu, natthi paccayo ñāṇāya dassanāya. ",
  "sn46.56:1.8": "Ahetu, appaccayo ñāṇaṁ dassanaṁ hotī’ti. ",
  "sn46.56:1.9": "Idha bhagavā kimāhā”ti? ",
  "sn46.56:1.10": "“Atthi, rājakumāra, hetu, atthi paccayo aññāṇāya adassanāya. ",
  "sn46.56:1.11": "Sahetu, sappaccayo aññāṇaṁ adassanaṁ hoti. ",
  "sn46.56:1.12": "Atthi, rājakumāra, hetu, atthi paccayo ñāṇāya dassanāya. ",
  "sn46.56:1.13": "Sahetu, sappaccayo ñāṇaṁ dassanaṁ hotī”ti. ",
  "sn46.56:2.1": "“Katamo pana, bhante, hetu, katamo paccayo aññāṇāya adassanāya? ",
  "sn46.56:2.2": "Kathaṁ sahetu, sappaccayo aññāṇaṁ adassanaṁ hotī”ti? ",
  "sn46.56:2.3": "“Yasmiṁ kho, rājakumāra, samaye kāmarāgapariyuṭṭhitena cetasā viharati kāmarāgaparetena, uppannassa ca kāmarāgassa